    "body": " Request: Whitelist npub for publishing on relay.zapstore.dev\n  Hi Zapstore team! I'd like to publish my Android app on Zapstore. I've already published the Nostr events to other relays, but relay.zapstore.dev rejects them with event pubkey is not allowed.\n  App Details\n  • Name: NeroHedge\n  • Package: xyz.nerodolla.wallet\n  • Category: Finance / Privacy\n  • Description: Self-custodial Monero (XMR) wallet with automated FX hedging via perpetual futures\n  • License: MIT\n  • Website: https://app.nerohedge.app\n  • Source: https://github.com/rpetermc/nerodolla\n  • APK: https://nerohedge.app/nerohedge-release.apk\n  Publishing Identity\n  • npub: npub1eydmpxn40ruu9tjsy2n9ucdgv3g3yqmdhfm5ekdthvjfqjcpsdss26l3nr\n  • pubkey (hex): c91bb09a7578f9c2ae5022a65e61a8645112036dba774cd9abbb24904b018361\n  Verification\n  • Identity proof (kind 30509): Already published and verifiable on relays — links APK signing certificate to the above Nostr pubkey\n  • APK certificate hash: 99899c3c9d3d0123c7d3a908753eb302f4664cdf645962cdad407eab4ec68887\n  • APK SHA256: a74a08af88848f2e888e513f31befd5ea58b9421ed8a9255b52bb803238e90ab\n  Events Already Published\n  The following events are live on wss://relay.primal.net and wss://nos.lol:\n   Kind    Description        Event ID\n  ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n   32267   App metadata       82b564237c62e1b4a45319df408ac89a815977b2cdfd51be72f6185f4dcc0abf\n   30063   Release pointer    66276191ce465df2f94a59c3c4391c9a6e1d85ea23087cf91d582a0a0f623eb1\n   3063    Release artifact   ceecb71c31bad5ee45ec12389d78532bfe8f5b443fa88d6731e44176d1fc8baf\n   30509   Identity proof     e74a8a56b95a1fcaee47e387e8172de47c87e6f7a69137dddf724323b042c663",
